  this can be estimated via the sample covariance:

  .. math::

     C_{ij} = \frac{1}{N - 1} \sum_{n=1}^N (X_{in} - \overline{X_i})(X_{jn} - \overline{X_j})

  Where :math:`\overline{X_i} = \frac{1}{N} \sum_{k=1}^N X_{ik}` is the mean of the
